{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.98] We in motherfuckin' New York, nigga\n[00:05.40] It's like 5 in the morning\n[00:07.18] Pushin' the shades back, looking at the city, this shit look brazy, nigga, uh\n[00:14.52] Alright, haha\n[00:21.04] Double cup when—\n[Verse 1]\n[00:24.04] Double cup when I wake up, Actavis a life-taker\n[00:27.00] Probably meet my maker, smoking exotic flavors\n[00:29.80] If I tote the shotty, I'ma blow the shotty, then I walk around like I don't know nobody\n[00:32.80] Upstairs, groupies waitin' in the lobby\n[00:34.22] Got a girlfriend, sorry, I ain't sorry\n[00:35.80] I ain't come to kick it\n[00:37.36] With any of these bitches\n[00:38.82] See, money, I've been gettin'\n[00:40.42] I fuck up a check, let it blow in the wind\n[00:41.92] Bitch, check my quota, I'm bigger and bolder and better than all of these niggas that's buzzin'\n[00:45.02] If it's a problem, my niggas'll clutch it\n[00:46.46] Pretty nigga, still'd shoot up the function\n[00:47.96] Top of the line, I got my hand on my .9, bitch, I'ma die about mine\n[00:51.04] I was told life was about elevations, just pick you a ladder, and start-up the climb\n[00:54.00] Can't be afraid to take risk after risk, gamble chip after chip, tryna stay on the grind\n[00:57.04] Was in the kitchen, cooked grits, but they weren't really grits, they were bricks, mom, I'm sorry, I lied\n[01:00.42] I can make it up to you this time\n[01:02.56] Bought my mom a car, she listen to my shit while she drive\n[01:05.60] I owe her the world, send disrespect her way, you gotta die\n[01:08.36] Feel the same way about my girl, them diamonds, make 'em twinkle like her eyes (Oh)\n[Chorus]\n[01:11.78] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it (Oh)\n[01:26.92] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[01:31.08] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[01:33.16] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[Verse 2]\n[01:36.08] Breaking pills down, I can't help it, it's a habit now\n[01:38.92] Piped the fuck up, turnt the fuck up, promise, ain't no coming down\n[01:41.68] You'd get burnt the fuck up, choppers on us if you came to fuck around\n[01:45.00] Look for your mom, she in town, giving head for some brown\n[01:48.04] I'm a dog off the leash, bitch, I bite, I don't growl (Hrr, hrr)\n[01:51.08] I don't bark, I'm in silence, I'ma shoot up the crowd\n[01:54.04] If he want smoke, give him cancer, I'm gon' blow him down\n[01:56.94] He ain't know it was a problem, then I bet he know it's a problem now\n[01:59.88] A kid from the trenches, was plottin' on riches, I made it, I did it\n[02:02.06] I'm shinin' on all of these niggas that said that I wouldn't be shit, I was shittin' on them ever since I was in it\n[02:05.86] Don't fuck with the Rémy, the Henny, yeah, none of that\n[02:07.44] I pour the codeine, I sip, ain't no coming back\n[02:09.00] You caught a play, I'ma act like a quarterback\n[02:10.38] Got a hundred in cash, I do not need a quarter back (Oh)\n[Chorus]\n[02:27.02] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it (Oh)\n[02:30.46] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[02:33.18] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[02:35.86] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[Verse]\n[02:37.34] Finna freestyle I can't help it, it's a habit now\n[02:38.98] Choppa's on me, bandana on me, I've been a savage now\n[02:42.06] All these niggas ain't shit but some hoes, niggas ain't shit but some fuckin' clowns\n[02:45.34] Told these niggas I'm real ass nigga\n[02:46.62] Fuck nigga, I don’t fuck around\n[02:48.32] Talkin' that shit I'ma up that blick motherfucka', I gun ya' down\n[02:51.14] I don't gotta walk shit, I don't gotta walk shit\n[02:52.64] Fuck nigga I run the town\n[02:54.32] Bitch I'm a dog\n[02:55.06] Bitch I'm a dog, I'm a fuckin' hound\n[02:57.72] Go between my foot in the fuckin' ground\n[03:00.16] Huh, aye, stomp a nigga head in a club\n[03:02.60] Matter fact, fuck him up then blow his dreads in the club\n[03:05.60] Bloody dreads in the club\n[03:07.10] Spreadin' dreads in the club\n[03:08.62] Takin' meds prolly perkies in my head, in the club\n[03:13.50] Shinin' on these dugs\n[03:15.12] Takin' W's, yeah everyday I wake up dubbin'\n[03:19.40] I bake that bitch no oven\n[03:21.66] She bad as hell, may put a muffin in her oven","words":[[1.82,1.92,"[Intro]"],[1.98,2.04,"We"],[2.1,2.12,"in"],[2.18,2.68,"motherfuckin'"],[2.72,2.8,"New"],[2.86,3.1,"York,"],[3.2,3.38,"nigga"],[5.4,5.52,"It's"],[5.56,5.74,"like"],[5.76,5.78,"5"],[5.96,5.98,"in"],[6.02,6.06,"the"],[6.14,6.46,"morning"],[7.18,7.44,"Pushin'"],[7.56,7.62,"the"],[7.66,7.78,"shades"],[7.88,8.02,"back,"],[8.06,8.24,"looking"],[8.3,8.36,"at"],[8.42,8.48,"the"],[8.58,8.7,"city,"],[8.74,8.86,"this"],[8.98,9.14,"shit"],[9.18,9.28,"look"],[9.38,9.74,"brazy,"],[9.84,10.0,"nigga,"],[10.92,11.04,"uh"],[14.52,14.88,"Alright,"],[14.92,21.0,"haha"],[21.04,21.22,"Double"],[21.32,21.54,"cup"],[21.58,21.64,"when—"],[21.7,23.96,"[Verse"],[23.98,24.0,"1]"],[24.04,24.2,"Double"],[24.28,24.4,"cup"],[24.44,24.54,"when"],[24.6,24.6,"I"],[24.68,24.86,"wake"],[24.92,25.0,"up,"],[25.56,25.92,"Actavis"],[25.96,25.96,"a"],[26.02,26.6,"life-taker"],[27.0,27.22,"Probably"],[27.3,27.46,"meet"],[27.54,27.68,"my"],[27.74,28.12,"maker,"],[28.4,28.76,"smoking"],[28.82,29.16,"exotic"],[29.2,29.76,"flavors"],[29.8,29.86,"If"],[29.96,29.96,"I"],[30.0,30.12,"tote"],[30.16,30.2,"the"],[30.26,30.48,"shotty,"],[30.52,30.68,"I'ma"],[30.74,30.86,"blow"],[30.9,30.94,"the"],[31.0,31.2,"shotty,"],[31.26,31.34,"then"],[31.4,31.4,"I"],[31.48,31.62,"walk"],[31.68,31.86,"around"],[31.9,32.02,"like"],[32.08,32.08,"I"],[32.14,32.28,"don't"],[32.32,32.38,"know"],[32.44,32.7,"nobody"],[32.8,33.18,"Upstairs,"],[33.24,33.48,"groupies"],[33.54,33.74,"waitin'"],[33.78,33.84,"in"],[33.88,33.92,"the"],[34.0,34.18,"lobby"],[34.22,34.34,"Got"],[34.38,34.38,"a"],[34.46,34.94,"girlfriend,"],[34.98,35.2,"sorry,"],[35.26